# ==============================================================================
# Joel Thomas Portfolio — Email Configuration (.env / Environment Variables)
# Choose EITHER Option A (EmailJS) OR Option B / C (Server Backend)
# Target Recipient: joelt6704@gmail.com
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OPTION A: EmailJS (Client-Side, Direct Delivery to Gmail)
# Recommended for static hosting / zero backend setup.
# 1. Create a free account at https://www.emailjs.com
# 2. Add an Email Service connected to joelt6704@gmail.com
# 3. Create an Email Template with variables:
#    - {{from_name}}, {{from_email}}, {{subject}}, {{inquiry_type}}, {{message}}, {{received_at}}
# 4. Copy your Service ID, Template ID, and Public Key below:
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=service_xxxxxxx
# VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=template_xxxxxxx
# VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=xxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OPTION B: Gmail SMTP via Google App Password (Server-Side / api/contact)
# Connects directly through Gmail's secure SMTP server.
# 1. Enable 2-Step Verification in your Google Account:
#    https://myaccount.google.com/security
# 2. Generate a 16-character App Password (Select App: "Mail", Device: "Portfolio"):
#    https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
# 3. Fill in your credentials below:
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# GMAIL_USER=joelt6704@gmail.com
# GMAIL_APP_PASSWORD=xxxx xxxx xxxx xxxx
# NOTIFICATION_EMAIL=joelt6704@gmail.com

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OPTION C: Resend Email API (Server-Side / api/contact)
# 1. Create a free account at https://resend.com
# 2. Generate an API Key
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# RESEND_API_KEY=re_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
# RESEND_FROM="Joel Thomas Portfolio <onboarding@resend.dev>"
# NOTIFICATION_EMAIL=joelt6704@gmail.com

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OPTIONAL: Supabase Database Storage (Store submissions in PostgreSQL table)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co
# SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-supabase-anon-key
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=your-supabase-service-role-key
